{"questionId":"u03-s008-v008","unitId":"u03","numericUnitId":3,"topicId":"u03-linear-equation-apps","skillId":"linear-equation-age-problem","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"2 年前，甲的年齡是乙的 3 倍；兩人今年合計 36 歲。乙今年幾歲？","choices":["10","8","12","26"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"以總和表示甲36-x；兩人都回到2年前；解得乙今年10歲。所以答案是「10」。","steps":["以總和表示甲36-x","兩人都回到2年前","解得乙今年10歲"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"10","truth":true,"reason":"兩年前兩人共 32 歲，按 3:1 分成四份，乙當時 8 歲，所以今年 10 歲。"},{"choice":"8","truth":false,"reason":"算出乙兩年前 8 歲後忘記加回 2 年。"},{"choice":"12","truth":false,"reason":"直接用今年總和 36 除以倍數 3，忽略總份數其實是 4。"},{"choice":"26","truth":false,"reason":"甲今年為 36−10=26 歲，這不是題目所問的乙。"}],"commonMistake":"只改變其中一人的時間。","concept":"所有年齡關係必須在同一時間點。","tags":["代數","年齡問題","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":["linear-equation-check-solution"],"authoringIntent":"結合總和與過去年齡倍數。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"36df6bed4f2cc79ed53089838e81bfab28478d18345b415dcfb7b48e4a1768ca","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","legacyContentDisposition":"replace-old-record-at-final-integration"}
{"questionId":"u03-s008-v009","unitId":"u03","numericUnitId":3,"topicId":"u03-linear-equation-apps","skillId":"linear-equation-age-problem","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"6 年後，母親將是 40 歲，而且當時母親年齡是女兒的 2 倍。女兒今年幾歲？","choices":["8","20","14","28"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"6 年後女兒為 x＋6 歲。當時母親 40 歲且是女兒的 2 倍，所以列 40＝2(x＋6)。解得 x＋6＝20，故 x＝14。","steps":["設女兒今年 x 歲，6 年後為 x＋6 歲。","依同一時間點的倍數關係列 40＝2(x＋6)。","解得 x＝14，並驗算 6 年後女兒 20 歲、母親 40 歲。"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"8","truth":false,"reason":"把40÷2後再減12。"},{"choice":"20","truth":false,"reason":"20是6年後年齡。"},{"choice":"14","truth":true,"reason":"6 年後女兒為 x＋6，40＝2(x＋6)，所以 x＋6＝20、x＝14。"},{"choice":"28","truth":false,"reason":"把14倍數化。"}],"commonMistake":"把「6年後」只套用在母親，卻用女兒今年的年齡比較倍數。","concept":"年齡倍數關係中的兩個年齡必須位於同一時間點。","tags":["代數","年齡問題","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":["linear-equation-check-solution"],"authoringIntent":"由同一個未來時間點的年齡倍數回推女兒現齡。","literacyContextNecessity":null,"reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"70724843a672cc0c1523fd3882001613d2ba30902f41259da4ddfb3d1a80fffc","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","legacyContentDisposition":"replace-old-record-at-final-integration"}
{"questionId":"u03-s008-v010","unitId":"u03","numericUnitId":3,"topicId":"u03-linear-equation-apps","skillId":"linear-equation-age-problem","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"三名學生年齡分別為 x、x＋2、x＋5 歲，合計 52 歲。最年輕者幾歲？","choices":["13","17","20","15"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"相加得3x+7；等於52；解得15。所以答案是「15」。","steps":["相加得3x+7","等於52","解得15"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"13","truth":false,"reason":"把52-7後除錯。"},{"choice":"17","truth":false,"reason":"17是第二人。"},{"choice":"20","truth":false,"reason":"20是最年長者。"},{"choice":"15","truth":true,"reason":"3x+7=52，3x=45，所以x=15。 因此此選項符合題目。"}],"commonMistake":"把平均年齡當最小年齡。","concept":"所有人用最小年齡表示。","tags":["代數","年齡問題","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":["linear-equation-check-solution"],"authoringIntent":"處理多人的年齡差與總和。","literacyContextNecessity":"三人的相對年齡差與總和決定3x+7=52，刪除人際年齡結構無法列式。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"1fe64bba18a50676b079a1816e25a5dd50e42e735e5343d8df128c7fbe3fdb62","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","legacyContentDisposition":"replace-old-record-at-final-integration"}
{"questionId":"u03-s008-v011","unitId":"u03","numericUnitId":3,"topicId":"u03-linear-equation-apps","skillId":"linear-equation-age-problem","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"家庭紀錄表提供兩項資料：哥哥今年比妹妹大 6 歲；4 年後兩人的年齡和是 36 歲。妹妹今年幾歲？","choices":["11","13","15","7"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"設妹妹今年 x 歲，哥哥為 x+6 歲；4 年後兩人是 x+4 與 x+10 歲，故 2x+14=36，解得 x=11。","steps":["設妹妹今年 x 歲，哥哥為 x+6 歲","把兩人都增加 4 歲","解 (x+4)+(x+10)=36"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"11","truth":true,"reason":"列式 (x+4)+(x+10)=36，得到 2x=22，所以 x=11。"},{"choice":"13","truth":false,"reason":"只替哥哥增加 4 歲，誤列 x+(x+10)=36，會得到 x=13。"},{"choice":"15","truth":false,"reason":"忽略兩人都經過 4 年，只用今年差 6 列 2x+6=36，會得到 x=15。"},{"choice":"7","truth":false,"reason":"正確算出妹妹今年 11 歲後，又多減一次 4 年，會得到 7。"}],"commonMistake":"只替其中一人增加 4 歲，或把 4 年前後的年齡混在同一個等式。","concept":"年齡差固定，但兩人在同一段時間後都會增加相同歲數。","tags":["代數","年齡問題","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":["linear-equation-check-solution"],"authoringIntent":"使用同一家庭中兩人的現在差與未來總和建立方程式。","literacyContextNecessity":"家庭紀錄中的年齡差與 4 年後總和缺一不可，且兩人必須移到同一時間點。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"c16ca13f872cf0c022406967c9cb36aa15f8bdd66c7358fc162935a09fc1382a","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","legacyContentDisposition":"replace-old-record-at-final-integration"}
{"questionId":"u03-s008-v012","unitId":"u03","numericUnitId":3,"topicId":"u03-linear-equation-apps","skillId":"linear-equation-age-problem","difficulty":"literacy","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"貓今年 x 歲，狗比貓大 3 歲。2 年後牠們的年齡和為 19 歲。貓今年幾歲？","choices":["7","6","8","9"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"將兩隻動物都加2歲；列(x+2)+(x+5)=19；解得6。所以答案是「6」。","steps":["將兩隻動物都加2歲","列(x+2)+(x+5)=19","解得6"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"7","truth":false,"reason":"只從 2 年後總和扣掉 2 歲而不是兩隻各 2 歲，會算 (17−3)/2=7。"},{"choice":"6","truth":true,"reason":"2 年後為 x+2 與 x+5，總和 19，所以 2x+7=19，x=6。"},{"choice":"8","truth":false,"reason":"用 2 年後總和 19 直接扣年齡差 3 再除 2，未扣兩隻增加的 4 歲，會得 8。"},{"choice":"9","truth":false,"reason":"直接把 19 除以 2 並取整，會誤選 9。"}],"commonMistake":"總和只加一次2年。","concept":"時間推移作用於每個個體。","tags":["代數","年齡問題","literacy"],"estimatedTimeSec":"75","prerequisiteSkillIds":["linear-equation-check-solution"],"authoringIntent":"處理兩個個體的未來年齡和。","literacyContextNecessity":"兩隻動物的年齡差與兩年後總和決定2x+7=19，時間與對象數量直接影響常數項。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"4e14bd986a19f6880b8fcbf6603baebc07951d6d85aa84023144ee005dd67b27","contentAuthority":"CHATGPT_HUMAN_AUTHORED_R1","legacyContentDisposition":"replace-old-record-at-final-integration"}
